// The design of the base-scale conformance plan: its own
// space.md, which wins over the scale's app-wide; space.header, a
// name the scale does not reserve, which keeps the app's meaning;
// box.pad, an expression over a base name the design leaves unset, which
// each host evaluates in its own column; and the probe's two
// colours, fixed in either scheme, which the hosts' corners are read
// against.
tamber scale

theme
  space.md = 12px
  space.header = 44px
  box.pad: length = calc(space.lg * 2)
  probe.fill = #0000ff  scheme=fixed
  probe.ground = #ffffff  scheme=fixed
